Subject: CPMS I03B Faithful JSON Byte Ingress Data Design

@ [design_uuid] 56332420-a1d9-4506-b003-94e65a810850

& [IngressLimits] is a closed immutable form
  + maximum_input_bytes u64 16777216
  + maximum_container_depth u64 128
  + maximum_object_members u64 65536
  + maximum_array_items u64 65536
  + maximum_scalar_values u64 131072
  + maximum_member_name_bytes u64 4096
  + maximum_number_token_bytes u64 4096
  + maximum_path_segments u64 128
  + maximum_diagnostic_characters u64 1024

& [JsonRootKind] is null boolean number string array or object
& [JsonPathSegment] is member with decoded String or index with u64
& [JsonIngressPath] is ordered Vec JsonPathSegment plus derived JSON Pointer rendering

& [JsonNumberToken] is ordered source metadata
  + start u64 end_exclusive u64
  + negative bool
  + integer_start integer_end_exclusive
  + fraction_start optional fraction_end_exclusive optional
  + exponent_marker optional exponent_negative optional exponent_start optional exponent_end_exclusive optional
  + raw bytes are resolved from the retained source span rather than copied

& [JsonIngressAccounts] contains
  + input_bytes maximum_depth object_members array_items scalar_values number_tokens
  + decoded_member_name_bytes_total and maximum_decoded_member_name_bytes
  + every value is u64 and formed through checked increments

& [FaithfulJsonInstance] contains
  + profile String fixed cantor-faithful-json-ingress/0.1
  + limits IngressLimits
  + source_bytes Vec u8
  + source_digest ContentDigest
  + root_kind JsonRootKind
  + accounts JsonIngressAccounts
  + number_tokens Vec JsonNumberToken ordered by start
  + no generic Value or reader result field

& [JsonIngressFaultCode] is invalid_utf8 forbidden_bom empty_input malformed_json trailing_data duplicate_key limit_exceeded or internal_fault
& [JsonGrammarClass] is closed and includes expected_value expected_key expected_colon expected_comma_or_end invalid_literal invalid_number invalid_string invalid_escape invalid_unicode_escape unpaired_surrogate unexpected_closer and unexpected_eof
& [JsonIngressLimitKind] names each IngressLimits field except diagnostic characters plus checked_arithmetic

& [JsonIngressFault] contains
  + profile String fixed cantor-faithful-json-ingress-fault/0.1
  + code JsonIngressFaultCode
  + stage byte utf8 lexical structural duplicate resource or internal
  + grammar_class optional JsonGrammarClass
  + offset u64
  + path JsonIngressPath
  + duplicate_name optional String
  + first_offset optional u64 second_offset optional u64
  + limit_kind optional JsonIngressLimitKind maximum optional u64 observed optional u64
  + message String bounded advisory

& [Result] is Result FaithfulJsonInstance JsonIngressFault
  + no separate partial or warning channel exists

& [ObjectFrame] contains path state member_names BTreeMap String to u64 and pending_member optional String
& [ArrayFrame] contains path state and next_index u64
& [Frame] is object or array and stack length equals current container depth

& [MemoryBound] follows input bytes aggregate names scalar count number-token count and path depth
  + accepted source bytes are copied once
  + number tokens reference spans
  + member maps are dropped as objects close
  + no input-derived allocation occurs before its governing byte or count limit check

& [DesignDisposition] is exact_candidate_forms_not_implemented
